{"cloudId": "gendvn.atlassian.net", "issueIdOrKey": "KS-963", "contentFormat": "adf", "responseContentFormat": "adf", "fields": {"description": {"type": "doc", "version": 1, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "f1014d04f1c3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "User Story"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "As a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Portfolio Manager", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", I want to add simulated future cash flows, save them with a name, and optionally share them with my team so that I can quickly reload and collaborate on scenario analysis before triggering a recalculation."}], "attrs": {"localId": "d8e44cafbc95"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "ff9a5503c809"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Overview"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Implements the Hypothetical Flows section on the Dashboard sub-tab. Users can add simulated cash flow entries, toggle them on/off, and save/load flow sets. The save model is "}, {"type": "text", "text": "explicit and named", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " \u2014 users click a \"Save Flows\" button to create a named snapshot, choose to keep it private or share it with the team. This replaces the previous pre-defined workspace model (CIO Flows / Operations Flows)."}], "attrs": {"localId": "89b8e2b1e526"}}, {"type": "blockquote", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Model Change (2026-04-07, Kathleen Bui):", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " The old \"CIO Flows / Operations Flows / My Flows\" workspace model has been replaced with a user-driven save-and-share model as specified below."}], "attrs": {"localId": "78a5e27ab00d"}}], "attrs": {"localId": "1640977c0ad4"}}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"width": 1640, "widthType": "pixel", "localId": "bc529bef4e5a", "layout": "align-start"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"type": "file", "id": "f6d893e7-6fec-4c84-ae86-8cf5360cea3f", "collection": "", "localId": "f6d893e7-overview", "height": 426, "width": 1640}}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "4e1fe230c815"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "36c4a3dba6f6"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Key Requirements"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "486792e308f8"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1. Adding a Hypothetical Flow Entry"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Required fields per entry:"}], "attrs": {"localId": "7ca5a568bf2f"}}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "a5f016c68836"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fund", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (dropdown from Solovis): "}, {"type": "text", "text": "auto-populates Beta", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " for current Solovis funds. Do not let the user modify this value"}], "attrs": {"localId": "d7ed7dc59305"}}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "17ee2625d5d3"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "If "}, {"type": "text", "text": "\"New Fund\"", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " is selected: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "additional fields for Beta", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (numeric, free dp) and other required fields per "}, {"type": "text", "text": "KS-949", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " contract"}], "attrs": {"localId": "9681149d10cc"}}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "15f45a6a84b3"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Amount ($ Million):", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (USD, HALF_UP, 3dp)"}], "attrs": {"localId": "bdef08caefb4"}}]}, {"type": "listItem", "